{"id":"5d8ac891559c0847","group":"72","path":"72/72-lem-system-t-reduction-soundness.md","title":"System T归约保持指称","display":"lem-system-t-reduction-soundness — System T归约保持指称","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-lem-system-t-reduction-soundness","aliases":["72-lem-system-t-reduction-soundness"],"display":"lem-system-t-reduction-soundness — System T归约保持指称","depends_on":["[[72-df-finite-type-arithmetic]]","[[72-df-system-t-denotation]]","[[72-lem-system-t-semantic-substitution]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; Chapter V by Jeremy Avigad and Solomon Feferman","source_location":"V §4.1 print356/PDF368 and §4.2 print357–358/PDF369–370; beta and recursor equations","verification_status":"proved-in-note; source reduction clauses checked","proof_status":"local beta, recursor and compatible-context proof checked; not machine verified","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-lem-system-t-reduction-soundness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-lem-system-t-reduction-soundness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-system-t-reduction-soundness — System T归约保持指称"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b4e2c27ac178897e\" href=\"?note=b4e2c27ac178897e\" title=\"72-df-finite-type-arithmetic\">72-df-finite-type-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9c9169e498db491f\" href=\"?note=9c9169e498db491f\" title=\"72-df-system-t-denotation\">72-df-system-t-denotation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"33c5548cb56e0a61\" href=\"?note=33c5548cb56e0a61\" title=\"72-lem-system-t-semantic-substitution\">72-lem-system-t-semantic-substitution</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; Chapter V by Jeremy Avigad and Solomon Feferman"},{"key":"source_location","html":"V §4.1 print356/PDF368 and §4.2 print357–358/PDF369–370; beta and recursor equations"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note; source reduction clauses checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local beta, recursor and compatible-context proof checked; not machine verified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_T,=_T,\\mathcal T_\\sigma\">\\(\\rho_T,=_T,\\mathcal T_\\sigma\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b4e2c27ac178897e\" href=\"?note=b4e2c27ac178897e\" title=\"72-df-finite-type-arithmetic\">72-df-finite-type-arithmetic</a> 中的带类型β及recursor归约和生成等式；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"⟦-⟧_\\eta,\\mathcal E_H\">\\(⟦-⟧_\\eta,\\mathcal E_H\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9c9169e498db491f\" href=\"?note=9c9169e498db491f\" title=\"72-df-system-t-denotation\">72-df-system-t-denotation</a>，代入引理取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"33c5548cb56e0a61\" href=\"?note=33c5548cb56e0a61\" title=\"72-lem-system-t-semantic-substitution\">72-lem-system-t-semantic-substitution</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathcal T_\\sigma\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathcal T_\\sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\\in\\mathcal E_H\">\\(\\eta\\in\\mathcal E_H\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_T^*\">\\(\\rho_T^*\\)</span> 为归约关系的自反传递闭包。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in\\rho_T\\ \\longrightarrow\\ ⟦ s⟧_\\eta=⟦ t⟧_\\eta.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in\\rho_T\\ \\longrightarrow\\ ⟦ s⟧_\\eta=⟦ t⟧_\\eta.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in\\rho_T^*\\ \\longrightarrow\\ ⟦ s⟧_\\eta=⟦ t⟧_\\eta.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in\\rho_T^*\\ \\longrightarrow\\ ⟦ s⟧_\\eta=⟦ t⟧_\\eta.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s=_Tt\\ \\longrightarrow\\ ⟦ s⟧_\\eta=⟦ t⟧_\\eta.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s=_Tt\\ \\longrightarrow\\ ⟦ s⟧_\\eta=⟦ t⟧_\\eta.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>根部β归约由代入引理立即得到；recursor在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf0\">\\(\\mathbf0\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf S n\">\\(\\mathsf S n\\)</span> 的两种根部归约恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_\\sigma\">\\(r_\\sigma\\)</span> 的两个递归等式。对单孔context归纳，把等值代入应用的函数位或参数位仍等值；λ之下对每个绑定值应用归纳假设，得到相同函数图。有限归约链再用相等的传递性；允许反向步时用对称性，即得生成等式的结论。证明不需要强规范化，也不从归约保持值错误推出归约必停机。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-finite-type-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"b4e2c27ac178897e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-finite-type-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-system-t-denotation","status":"resolved","id":"9c9169e498db491f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-system-t-denotation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-system-t-semantic-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"33c5548cb56e0a61","anchor":"ref-3","targ